  "contentHtml": "<p>#결정 #소금 #이온결합 #천일염<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^<br>소금 결정을 아이들에게 보여주고 싶을때 결국 못찾았었는데 오늘 우연히 봤네요. 언젠가 쓰기위해 지금 공유합니다.<br>좋은 소금은 정확히 6면체라고 하네용~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/23addb8179263827b9b5025878540b69265a2164\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/23addb8179263827b9b5025878540b69265a2164\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3edea16131d1e8ff08728e181da7e7f36e459d0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3edea16131d1e8ff08728e181da7e7f36e459d0\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edc52d4ffda8436ce8e23a45911311dcd349c7c1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edc52d4ffda8436ce8e23a45911311dcd349c7c1\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"852\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"http://www.ohmynews.com/NWS_Web/View/at_pg.aspx?CNTN_CD=A0001219706\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://www.ohmynews.com/NWS_Web/View/at_pg.aspx?CNTN_CD=A0001219706</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
